# ====================================================================
# Civitai API Configuration
# ====================================================================
#
# This file contains configuration for the Civitai Bulk Downloader node.
#
# SETUP INSTRUCTIONS:
# 1. Rename this file from ".env.example" to ".env"
# 2. Add your Civitai API key below
# 3. Save the file
#
# HOW TO GET YOUR CIVITAI API KEY:
# 1. Go to https://civitai.com/
# 2. Log in to your account
# 3. Navigate to: Account Settings → API Keys
#    Direct link: https://civitai.com/user/account
# 4. Click "Add API Key" or copy your existing key
# 5. Paste the key below (replace "your_api_key_here")
#
# SECURITY NOTE:
# - Never commit the .env file to git (it's in .gitignore)
# - Never share your API key publicly
# - The API key allows access to your Civitai account
#
# ====================================================================

# Your Civitai API Key
# Example: CIVITAI_API_KEY=1234567890abcdef1234567890abcdef
CIVITAI_API_KEY=your_api_key_here
